{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a demo build.</strong> While it faithfully implements the core features of the full game, the overall volume is smaller, and some elements may differ from the final release. We kindly ask for your understanding\u2014and we\u2019d greatly appreciate any feedback you can share!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713400/extras/987133399e306c028820da61374332b8.webp?t=1759300133\" width=442 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713400/extras/f5cf5dce79b41f9050b6d567be427fa4.poster.avif?t=1759300133\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713400/extras/f5cf5dce79b41f9050b6d567be427fa4.webm?t=1759300133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713400/extras/f5cf5dce79b41f9050b6d567be427fa4.mp4?t=1759300133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect, expand, and upgrade cars to forge your own deck. The longer and taller your train, the more happiness it produces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713400/extras/d313add76450ea20d0b087894e9a45a4.poster.avif?t=1759300133\" width=1170 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713400/extras/d313add76450ea20d0b087894e9a45a4.webm?t=1759300133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713400/extras/d313add76450ea20d0b087894e9a45a4.mp4?t=1759300133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover artifacts that amplify your strength. Mix and match artifacts and train cars to craft your ever-happier engine of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713400/extras/8daeb8eeb49a9f70c82ec4f28b651270.webp?t=1759300133\" width=338 height=47 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713400/extras/969f51e0ea10195660feaf5fdf61f5c3.poster.avif?t=1759300133\" width=974 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713400/extras/969f51e0ea10195660feaf5fdf61f5c3.webm?t=1759300133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713400/extras/969f51e0ea10195660feaf5fdf61f5c3.mp4?t=1759300133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the Conductor, you alone guide society aboard the last train. From petty squabbles to fateful crises, every choice carries weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713400/extras/7b7c451ce34406f59d9ec13f04a1647c.webp?t=1759300133\" width=413 height=40 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713400/extras/251c1e01409d5f3e934ca2ce5798ad31.poster.avif?t=1759300133\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/